    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>Vessels, generally made of earthenware, stoneware or porcelain and often of large capacity, which have a narrow neck and a handle (usually a vertical loop or scroll handle); may sometimes have a pouring lip. [Source: Getty AAT]</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
